{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cfc9779d40105dc746201172bb471d69ead2d7c2bf9c17e65a082667a2b565af",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24604343d5b3c7dc53b906932342cc70b92f6a6363b5c417d6909d24f857da60",
      "text": "和大家一起度过的新年",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4967c73d6fd37b49e728344cbed5a2056a32c71b47499f7a61dfb5974c733945",
      "text": "制作人酱，新的一年再次请多关照啦！\n接下来这1年，我也要全力以赴咯～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61d65db58a34769cd9d5f42824aed02b69bffd2228422ec309def21b7f7cf06b",
      "text": "新年快乐！\n元旦演唱会辛苦各位了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7038eee215125341041c8157a2ea0a6b1148d096f7b700541787ccccc8f97b0",
      "text": "今年的新年，又是看新年日出又是元旦演唱会的，\n内容满满超——开心啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ee64e52e608af950e569625e3f28e0c57a01cfce626c9866ff2d51efe01c45d",
      "text": "而且还有旬的生日派对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00356a1b512e715b4c1bd49fc81c0e4d911e98a20a08b40c24bb2a75a74e6ec7",
      "text": "这么闹腾的新年开端，我还是头一次经历呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c2748c48d95db8211c0a5f6302983653e54387de325b2c7fe559e5adcc0259a",
      "text": "嗯……\n大家一起看新年日出，很开心……呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f24514b41438f377a66cfbf6a7609fe2cfdabefbd219ba100a47974c71dca5",
      "text": "明年也大家一起去新年参拜吧！\n光是想想，我现在就兴奋起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69e84cf0069d21bcfaea8b4b5be3b69d7cb6f62aaf4414636f107d85952046a8",
      "text": "既然这样，换个和今年不一样的地方一起看\n新年日出，不也挺有意思的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a433824ec10d2ae26a9e0decb1599415319127ffcc99e3b61fcc4c5204e2dcb",
      "text": "那我们就先把制作人酱明年的\n新年假期预约下啦！下次要一起去哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00532a7e0c3ef9e56ccfa5ccd1af14d6e6bec3029fb036fcb0207d97b6811990",
      "text": "这是不是有点高兴得太早了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59e834d16b9e198f417c396b3b783868bee0e9b9c5b5f2f47c348b32ddc1d528",
      "text": "不过，只要和大家在一起的话……\n肯定……今年也一眨眼……就过去了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34bc7a5964f106f6c0587737e1eea6fea1e891e7b91c0e649a679330de3aa71b",
      "text": "确实！那我现在就\n开始准备今年的跨年好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5535af10c8cef599408269bd0b95fb8a6d1d3fde07bc102b941c46872b46e796",
      "text": "我还想再和大家一起开演唱会呢。\n为了这个，今年也必须要加油才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_008_23_5_00_008_23:5_00_008_23:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:340f39446cbab35b9eb5ef7bce7bdb9559b4362d898dc5f119e9c5a05bd84fcd",
      "text": "啊啊，说的没错。\n今年大家也一起向着更高处迈进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
